<section class="contact-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-num">06 / CONTATTO</div>
    <h2>Prima di un contratto, <i>una conversazione.</i></h2>
    <p class="contact-text">
      Trenta minuti, senza impegno. Mi racconti la situazione, ti dico onestamente
      se posso esserti utile e in che forma. Se non lo sono, ti indico chi può.
    </p>
    <a href="/contatti/" class="btn btn-light">Prenota una conversazione →</a>

    <div class="contact-meta">
      <div>
        <div class="contact-meta-label">Email</div>
        <div class="contact-meta-val">marco@rm-solution.it</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="contact-meta-label">Sede</div>
        <div class="contact-meta-val">Varese / Milano</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="contact-meta-label">LinkedIn</div>
        <div class="contact-meta-val">/in/marcoregalia</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-cta {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 112px) 0;
  }
  .contact-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #9a958c;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .contact-cta h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--paper);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .contact-cta h2 i { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-light); }
  .contact-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #bcb6ab;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .contact-meta {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid #2a2925;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .contact-meta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #7a766f;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .contact-meta-val {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .contact-meta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
